<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">Faiths Side by Side</h1>
<p class="ref-lede">The 30 religions the Institute profiles, set beside one another: where and when each began, who founded or first taught it, what it holds sacred in writing, and who follows it today. Each line is the short answer; the profile behind it tells the faith as its followers hold it and as historians describe it. The order is by age, and says nothing of rank.</p></header>
